Hello Sofia, here is a new voice note for you.
It is Sunday evening and I am sitting on my sofa.
I am very tired today, but really happy.
I will tell you about my Sunday now.
I woke up very early this morning.
I did not stay in bed for long.
I got up.
The sun came out early already.
It shone right into my room.
I went to the window.
I saw the blue sky.
Then I quickly made a plan.
I traveled out of the city for a day.
I traveled to Potsdam.
That is an old city right next to Berlin.
The weather stayed fantastic all day.
Listen closely, I will tell you everything now!
